            "type": "MCQ",
            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p data-end=\"934\" data-start=\"836\">Consider the following two NFAs $A_1$ and $A_2$. Which one of the following is true?</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"183\" src=\"https://cdn.mathpix.com/snip/images/7YRojk8alyCzB52Wo-G7fjeJzNvL5YvUvb9kVjnSIvg.original.fullsize.png\" width=\"737\"/></p></div></span>",
