            "marks": 1,
            "neg": 0.33,
            "type": "MCQ",
            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p data-end=\"762\" data-start=\"685\">The cardinality of the language recognized by the below NFA is:</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"232\" src=\"https://cdn.mathpix.com/snip/images/QLTJD-8RTMDrzwYwnU0qCdrYaQciNasnupszPMtXqT4.original.fullsize.png\" width=\"526\"/></p></div></span>",
