            "neg": 0.33,
            "type": "MCQ",
            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p data-end=\"455\" data-start=\"390\">What is the language accepted by the following NFA?</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"215\" src=\"https://cdn.mathpix.com/snip/images/ssjhKRN8YUPKvizt6EEx6IE6QhL6s5fsWR_dsTjTYsE.original.fullsize.png\" width=\"680\"/></p></div></span>",
