            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p data-end=\"3489\" data-start=\"3060\">Which state in the following DFA should be made the initial state to make it accept the language </p><p data-end=\"3489\" data-start=\"3060\">$L = \\{w \\in \\{0,1\\}^* \\mid w$ has even number of $1$s and odd number of $0$s$\\}$?</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"323\" src=\"https://cdn.mathpix.com/snip/images/LrgtAN8OHLoEAGBDYJ37My_npPeHxZiFu1c3MV5Fja0.original.fullsize.png\" width=\"309\"/></p></div></span>",
            "image": "https://cdn.mathpix.com/snip/images/LrgtAN8OHLoEAGBDYJ37My_npPeHxZiFu1c3MV5Fja0.original.fullsize.png",
