            "type": "MCQ",
            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p>Which of the following states would be notated as the final state/acceptance state for $L = \\{x \\in \\Sigma^* : \\text{length of } x \\text{ is } 2\\},\\ \\Sigma = \\{a,b\\}$?</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"241\" src=\"https://cdn.mathpix.com/snip/images/W3WXIRUo_684ve-4LmEOtPi28aRGrNEjoRePFjadWLc.original.fullsize.png\" width=\"403\"/></p></div></span>",
