            "type": "MSQ",
            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p data-end=\"617\" data-start=\"468\">Let $\\Sigma = \\{a,b,c\\}$ and $L = \\{w \\in \\Sigma^* \\mid w$ ends in $a$, $bb$, or $ccc\\}$. Which of the following strings belong to $L$?</p></div></span>",
            "image": "",
