            "type": "MCQ",
            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p data-end=\"656\" data-start=\"551\">Let $\\Sigma$ be an alphabet. Which of the following best describes $\\mathrm{P}(\\Sigma^*)$?</p></div></span>",
            "image": "",
