            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p data-end=\"4407\" data-start=\"4185\">Let $\\Sigma = \\{a,b,c,d,e\\}$ and $L = \\{w \\in \\Sigma^* \\mid$ the letters in $w$ are sorted alphabetically$\\}$. Which option lists exactly the strings that belong to $L$ from $abcde, bee, a, \\epsilon, decade$?</p></div></span>",
