            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p>Which two of the following four regular expressions are equivalent? ($\\varepsilon$ is the empty string).<br/><br/>i. $0^* 1(0+1)^*$<br/><br/>ii. $(0+1)^* 10^*$<br/><br/>iii. $0^* 1^* 0^*$<br/><br/>iv. $(0+1)^* 1(0+1)^*$<br/>(Select all that apply.)</p></div></span>",
