            "type": "MCQ",
            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p> </p><p> </p><p><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-5ceeb508-7fff-9047-4a83-b766e033b624\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"226\" src=\"https://gateoverflow.in/?qa=blob&amp;qa_blobid=7622991288691025098\" width=\"372\"/></b></p><p>The language accepted by this automaton is given by the regular expression</p></div></span>",
            "image": "https://gateoverflow.in/?qa=blob&qa_blobid=7622991288691025098",
