            "type": "MCQ",
            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p>Which two of the following four regular expressions are equivalent over the alphabet $\\{a, b\\}$ ? ( $\\epsilon$ is the empty string).<br/><br/>i. $(a+b)^*$<br/><br/>ii. $a^*\\left(b a^*\\right)^*$<br/><br/>iii. $a^* b^*+b^* a^*$<br/><br/>iv. $(a b+b a)^*$</p></div></span>",
