                "<span style=\"display: inline;\">$L\\left(G^{\\prime}\\right)=\\left\\{0^n 1 \\mid n \\geq 1\\right\\} \\cup\\left\\{01^{2 n} \\mid n \\geq 1\\right\\}$<br/></span>",
                "<span style=\"display: inline;\">$L\\left(G^{\\prime}\\right)=\\left\\{0^{2 n} 1 \\mid n \\geq 1\\right\\} \\cup\\left\\{01^{2 n} \\mid n \\geq 1\\right\\}$<br/></span>",
