                "<span style=\"display: inline;\">$L(G)=\\left\\{a^i b^j c^k \\mid i, j, k \\geq 1\\right.$ and $(i=k$ or $\\left.i=j)\\right\\}$<br/></span>",
                "<span style=\"display: inline;\">$L(G)=\\left\\{a^i b^j c^k \\mid i, j, k \\geq 1\\right.$ and $(i=j$ or $\\left.j=k)\\right\\}$<br/></span>",
