            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p>Let $L_1=\\left\\{\\langle M\\rangle \\mid M\\right. \\text{ is a TM that halts on every input of the form} \\left.0^n 1^n\\right\\}$.<br/><br/>Which of the following is <strong>true</strong> about $L_1$ ?<br/> </p></div></span>",
